 their spells and items so you come to no encounter unprepared.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/b32c0b022d74767a51c240b8dec8ac88.poster.avif?t=1753467040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/b32c0b022d74767a51c240b8dec8ac88.webm?t=1753467040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/b32c0b022d74767a51c240b8dec8ac88.mp4?t=1753467040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Encounter beings that can help, or slow you down, along your path.</strong> Sacrificial chambers grant rewards for risking your life or coin, shops contain rare items and consumables, enchanted anvils allow you to create items, cursed rooms debilitate your party, or empower your enemies, during your next combat encounter, and many more interactions through the many room types.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/1fc3a35219d2afdd6ab2fd95d9c72321.poster.avif?t=1753467040\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/1fc3a35219d2afdd6ab2fd95d9c72321.webm?t=1753467040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/652050/extras/1fc3a35219d2afdd6ab2fd95d9c72321.mp4?t=1753467040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
